## Lore

A Nightbane belonging to one of the more magic or scholastically oriented
groups - the Nocturnes, Seekers and Lightbringers. These Nightbane have a broad
range of knowledge and technical or scientific skills. Or the character might
have been a graduate student in any scholastic or scientific field when he
changed.

It is one of four skill packages for the Nightbane R.C.C. The packages are
guidelines: a Game Master may allow skills outside them for a convincing
reason.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'nb-package-nocturne');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'nb-package-nocturne';

